{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3223","id":3595572116,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887WUBOU","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3223","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3223.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3223.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3223","number":3223,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"policy: surface exit nodes via autogroup:internet","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`compileFilterRules` skipped `autogroup:internet` destinations to keep them out of the wire-format `PacketFilter`, but those compiled rules also feed `pm.matchers`. `Node.CanAccess` looks at a matcher whose `DestsIsTheInternet` covers the public internet to surface exit-node peers to ACL sources — with the skip in place no such matcher existed, exit nodes silently dropped out of the source's peer list, and the `ref/routes/#setup-an-exit-node` walkthrough stopped working: `tailscale exit-node list` returned `no exit nodes found` and `tailscale set --exit-node=<ip>` returned `no node found in netmap with IP`.\n\nThe skip lands in `filter.go`. Removing it lets `autogroup:internet` flow through normal matcher derivation. To keep the wire-format PacketFilter correct on advertisers, `ReduceFilterRules` now keeps a destination on exit-route advertisers when every prefix sits inside `util.TheInternet()` — Tailscale SaaS sends those rules to exit nodes so the advertiser's kernel filter accepts traffic forwarded by `autogroup:internet` sources.\n\nVerified against a live Tailscale SaaS tailnet on 2026-04-28 via `tscap`. The b17/b18 captures land under `testdata/issue_3212/` as a regression guard. They are isolated from `testdata/routes_results/` because the broader `TestRoutesCompat` machinery assumes a CIDR-prefix wire format that differs from the IPSet-range form SaaS emits for `autogroup:internet`; aligning that wire format is tracked separately.\n\nFixes #3212\n\n> Generated with the help of an AI assistant","created_at":"2026-04-28T11:32:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T10:24:34Z","closed_at":"2026-04-29T10:24:33Z","merged_at":"2026-04-29T10:24:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"ba251e7b472ffabefdc1061eb00afc069d0ac562","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/repos","events_url":"